Make the `bindgen` build-dependency of `wasmer` optional, enabled only by `v8`.

`lib/api/build.rs` only uses bindgen in `build_v8()`, behind `cfg(feature = "v8")`,
but `bindgen` is an unconditional build-dependency. On musl build hosts (such as
BinaryBuilder's) it is configured with `features = ["static"]`, which makes clang-sys
link libclang statically and its build script fails with "could not find the required
libclang.a static library". The C API does not use the v8 backend, so don't build
bindgen/clang-sys at all. `Cargo.lock` is unchanged (optional dependencies are
locked too), so `--locked` still works.

Upstream: not yet reported.

diff --git a/lib/api/Cargo.toml b/lib/api/Cargo.toml
